  "description": "Starting incumbent for the test-time-loops loop: the 2026-10-06 spike's looped trunk (1 entry block, 2 shared core blocks, 1 exit block, input re-injection) trained on 1-8 random loops, with the old harness's expert iteration moved into rl() and changed in one way: each round samples every target 8 times at each of 1, 2, 4 and 8 loops. Sets the first 3-seed mean under the new harness.",
